    {
      "_key": "k0036",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "(Product Growth Leader & Innovation Strategist)",
          "_key": "k0037"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0038",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "With over 15 years of experience scaling organizations, launching market-defining products, and aligning cross-functional teams, Joshua knows what it takes to drive real impact. He has led major strategic initiatives across HR Tech, Ed Tech, and platform product management, using analytics, market foresight, and compelling storytelling to fuel product growth.",
          "_key": "k0039"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0040",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "As the founder of Aversatility, Joshua provides advisory services in product leadership, innovation research, and strategic execution. He’s passionate about harnessing AI and data-driven insights to accelerate decision-making and drive market success.",
          "_key": "k0041"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0042",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Beyond his professional expertise, Joshua is an avid explorer of national parks, a long-distance runner, and a mentor to up-and-coming product leaders.",
          "_key": "k0043"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0044",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0003"
          ],
          "text": "Host: Brady Halligan",
          "_key": "k0045"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "k0003",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/bradyhalligan/"
        }
      ],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0046",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "(Senior Strategist at O3 & Innovation Expert)",
          "_key": "k0047"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0048",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Brady brings a wealth of experience in strategy, innovation, and business consulting, helping organizations—from startups to Fortune 10 companies—navigate complex challenges and unlock growth. At O3, he specializes in digital transformation, customer experience, and strategic design, ensuring that businesses stay ahead of the curve.",
          "_key": "k0049"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0050",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Brady has also instructed at institutions like the University of Pennsylvania and Reykjavik University and has spoken on innovation, sustainability, and social impact at organizations like the United Nations.",
          "_key": "k0051"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
